 end="00:34.650">It </span><span begin="00:34.650" end="00:35.010">might </span><span begin="00:35.010" end="00:35.130">of </span><span begin="00:35.130" end="00:35.400">hurt </span><span begin="00:35.400" end="00:35.880">worse </span><span begin="00:35.880" end="00:36.060">to </span><span begin="00:36.060" end="00:36.510">hear </span><span begin="00:36.510" end="00:36.720">you </span><span begin="00:36.720" end="00:37.980">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.980" end="00:40.740"><span begin="00:37.980" end="00:38.040">"</span><span begin="00:38.040" end="00:38.520">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:39.270">leaving</span><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.270">; </span><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:40.710">goodbye</span><span begin="00:40.710" end="00:40.740">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.770" end="00:44.370"><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:41.100">But </span><span begin="00:41.100" end="00:41.280">your </span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.730">smile </span><span begin="00:41.730" end="00:42.180">still </span><span begin="00:42.180" end="00:42.570">makes </span><span begin="00:42.570" end="00:42.960">my </span><span begin="00:42.960" end="00:43.350">heart </span><span begin="00:43.350" end="00:44.370">sing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.460" end="00:46.470"><span begin="00:44.460" end="00:45.360">Another </span><span begin="00:45.360" end="00:45.750">sad </span><span begin="00:45.750" end="00:46.470">song</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.710" end="00:49.830"><span begin="00:46.710" end="00:46.890">I </span><span begin="00:46.890" end="00:47.310">can't </span><span begin="00:47.310" end="00:47.970">forget </span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.120">it</span><span begin="00:48.120" end="00:48.120">, </span><span begin="00:48.120" end="00:48.330">I </span><span begin="00:48.330" end="00:48.840">won't </span><span begin="00:48.840" end="00:49.530">regret </span><span begin="00:49.530" end="00:49.830">it</span></